# Dansship UI Overview

React 19 + TypeScript SPA (Vite). Stack: React Router 7, i18next, Tailwind v4, Radix/shadcn-style UI, `polpo` / `polpo-http-client`.

## Tooling

- Node `>24.14.0`; package manager `pnpm@11.2.2` (`corepack pnpm` if needed)
- Validate: `corepack pnpm build`, then `corepack pnpm lint` (`--max-warnings 0`). No test script today.

## Path aliases (prefer these)

- `@components/*`, `@contexts`, `@core/*`, `@helpers`, `@hooks`, `@pages`

## Where code lives

| Concern | Location |
| --- | --- |
| Routes | `src/core/router.tsx` |
| Page exports | `src/pages/` + `src/pages/index.ts` |
| API clients | `src/core/api/<domain>/` via `DansshipAPI` |
| Data hooks | `src/hooks/services/` |
| Layouts / UI / features | `src/components/{layouts,ui,modules,forms,form-fields}/` |
| Locales | `public/locales/es/<ns>.json` + namespaces in `src/core/i18n.ts` |
| URLs / options | `src/core/constants.ts` (`PageURLS`) |
| Permissions | `src/core/permissions.ts` |

## Change rules

- Reuse existing module boundaries; do not invent new top-level folders.
- New/changed routes: update `router.tsx` **and** page barrel exports.
- New copy: update locale JSON **and** register namespace in `i18n.ts` if new.
- Shared primitives → `components/ui`; feature UI → `components/modules/<feature>`.
- Auth/errors: use constants from `@core/constants`; pages consume normalized values (`errorCode`), not raw API envelopes.
- Public routes must stay SPA-safe (`vercel.json` rewrite to `index.html`).
